{"sourceUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/jkzyyjy/info/1088/1668.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.602209+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/jkzyyjy/info/1088/1668.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n<div>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span>为进一步促进高校优秀大学生间的交流互动，增进对河南医药大学健康中原研究院的全面了解，助力优秀大学生选报我院研究生，我院特举办<span>2025</span>年大学生暑期夏令营活动。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>一、招生人数： </span></strong><span> 5</span><span>人</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>二、活动时间：</span></strong><span>  2025</span><span>年<span>7</span>月<span>8</span>日</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>三、活动内容与形式</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>本次夏令营活动采用线上线下相结合的形式开展，申请线上参加的同学请提前安装腾讯会议，线下活动在河南医药大学南校区求真楼六楼东健康中原研究院会议室进行。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>会议内容如下，腾讯会议<span>ID</span>另行通知。</span></strong></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>日期</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>内容</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>备注</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月<span>1</span>日<span>-7</span>月<span>5</span>日</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>夏令营报名</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span> </span></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p><span>7</span><span>月<span>8</span>日上午<span>9:00</span></span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>1.</span><span>开营仪式</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span>研究院简介</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span>营员科研计划汇报</span></p></td>\n<td><p><span>营员每人准备<span>5</span>分钟<span>PPT</span>，汇报科研经验和科研计划</span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><strong><span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>四、招生对象</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身心健康；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>国内各高校<span>2026</span>年应届本科毕业生，医学及生物学背景相关专业学生优先；</span></p>\n<p><span>3. </span><span>英语水平良好；</span></p>\n<p><span>4. </span><span>无任何学术不端行为及违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>五、申请材料</span></strong></p>\n<p><span>具体材料要求如下：</span></p>\n<p><span>1. </span><span>《健康中原研究院<span>2025</span>年大学生暑期夏令营申请表》（在本文末下载）；</span></p>\n<p><span>2. </span><span>个人简历（包括个人基本情况、学习经历、科研实践经历、未来学习和研究计划等）；</span></p>\n<p><span>3.</span><span>其他材料（如已发表论文、专利或参与科研项目情况、获奖证书等，论文提供封面及首页，没有可不提供）；</span></p>\n<p><span>以上<span>1-3</span>材料按顺序整理扫描后合并成为一个<span>PDF</span>文件，以<span>“</span>姓名<span>”</span>命名，发送至邮箱</span><span><a href=\"mailto:1150268869@qq.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>1150268869@qq.com</span></a></span><span>。我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，确定入营学员名单。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>六、联系方式</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>联系部门：</span></strong><span>河南医药大学健康中原研究院</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>联系人：</span></strong><span>马老师</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>联系电话：</span></strong><span>0373-3831761</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span>健康中原研究院</span></p>\n<p><span>2025</span><span>年<span>7</span>月<span>1</span>日</span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"be481ebba72ecada45a15d617a0a141191c40e776243b212422df59881a17b49","textLength":671,"sourceSha256":"6bf65b46ceeb0911cb6f2ba502305902835da210ed36294cbc41b0d6793428dc","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1-2025年河南医药大学健康中原研究院大学生暑期夏令营申请表.doc","url":"https://www.xxmu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1680685829&wbfileid=11983233"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-fd054dabc73841448e26","title":"2025年河南医药大学健康中原研究院2025年大学生暑期夏令营活动招生简章","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:59:28.602209+00:00"}
